00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760
Running, I'll give you 7 out of 10.

2
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:04,660
Running is a very good form of exercise.

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:07,080
However, it does pose problems

4
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,680
to your knees, ankles

5
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:11,280
and the other musculoskeletal system.

6
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,700
Running is a good source of exercise,

7
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,210
