11
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,240
So if you have got a normal heart,

12
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,060
running improves your cardiac function.

13
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:25,160
Running improves your

14
00:00:25,160 --> 00:00:27,500
VO₂ or maximum oxygen extraction

15
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,480
of the blood,

16
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,280
and it also promotes

17
